OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews back at burnt hotel
OL,4,Aafter smoke report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe call came four days after a large
OL,7,Ffire broke out at the hotel on Marine
OL,8,FParade in the early hours of Saturday,
OL,9,Fwith 280 people evacuated from the
OL,10,Fbuilding.
